                            ▼
                   ┌────────────────┐
                   │ C5 Challenger   │  downgrade-only adversary pass
                   └────────┬───────┘
                            │ FieldVerdict[] (settled)
                            ▼
                   ┌────────────────┐
                   │ C6 Scorer       │  pure function, no judgment
                   └────────┬───────┘
                            │ ScoreSheet
                            ▼
                   ┌────────────────┐
